{"word":"γεραρός","uri":"geraros","senses":[{"word":"γεραρός","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">γεραρός,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ά, όν</span>\n[<span class=\"grec\">ᾰ</span>] digne de respect, vénérable\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> imposant par son aspect, <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 170, 211 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> vénérable par son âge,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de vieillards,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ag.</span> <span class=\"refch\">722 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Suppl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">42 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Alex.</span> <span class=\"refch\">26 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">A. Pl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 359,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> vénérable par sa condition,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de prêtres,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Suppl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">667 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">γεραραί</span>\n(<span class=\"ital\">var.</span> <span class=\"grec\">γεραιραί</span>)\n<span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1369, 1371,\n1372,</span> les vénérables prêtresses de Dionysos ; <span class=\"ital\">p. ext. en parl. de choses :</span> <span class=\"grec\">τράπεζα γ.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xénophan.</span>\n(<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">462</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>), table imposante,\n<span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span> somptueuse ; <span class=\"grec\">τὸ γεραρὸν ἤθους,</span> <span class=\"aut\">M. Ant.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 15,</span> caractère digne de respect ||\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Cp.</span> <span class=\"grec\">γεραρώτερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 211</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Ét